---
const supportChannels = [
  {
    id: 'alipay',
    name: '支付宝',
    description: '使用支付宝扫码支持',
    src: '/support/alipay.jpg',
    alt: '支付宝收款码',
    width: 1080,
    height: 1621,
    chip: 'bg-google-blue/10 text-google-blue',
  },
  {
    id: 'wechat',
    name: '微信',
    description: '使用微信扫码支持',
    src: '/support/wechat.png',
    alt: '微信收款码',
    width: 1123,
    height: 1527,
    chip: 'bg-google-green/10 text-google-green',
  },
];
---

<section id="support" class="scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(520px,0.9fr)] lg:items-start">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">
          支持项目
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-on-surface">
          支持原点系列持续维护。
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-on-surface-variant">
          如果这些工具节省了你的时间，可以通过支付宝或微信自愿赞助。赞助将用于功能优化、问题修复、发布维护和必要的开发成本。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant/80">
          赞助不是使用条件，应用的下载、开源与隐私承诺不受影响。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
        {supportChannels.map((channel) => (
          <article class="m3-card p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby={`support-${channel.id}`}>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
              <div>
                <h3 id={`support-${channel.id}`} class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface">
                  {channel.name}
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                  {channel.description}
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class={`shrink-0 inline-flex items-center h-7 px-3 rounded-full text-xs font-medium ${channel.chip}`}>
                收款码
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 rounded-[var(--radius-m3)] bg-white p-3 shadow-m3-1">
              <img
                src={channel.src}
                alt={channel.alt}
                width={channel.width}
                height={channel.height}
                loading="lazy"
                class="mx-auto h-auto w-full rounded-[18px]"
              />
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-on-surface-variant/70">
      扫码前请确认收款方信息，按需自愿支持。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
